# Test output, and every real .evtx a developer keeps locally.
# No exception: the repository tracks no .evtx at all. It used to track
# testdata/system.evtx, and deriving the format from that one sample while
# also asserting against it is what cost this project seventeen tasks.
testdata/*.evtx
